<BaseLayout title="About | Word of Faith Church of God"><section class="py-20"><div class="container-shell max-w-4xl"><p class="eyebrow">About Word of Faith</p><h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-bold text-wine-dark">Worship. Scripture. Community. Service.</h1><p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-stone-700">Word of Faith is a Pentecostal Christian church in Neptune, New Jersey. Our approved church history and final local mission wording will be added here after leadership review.</p><h2 class="mt-12 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-wine-dark">What we believe</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-stone-700">The church is affiliated with the Church of God. Production content should reference the denomination’s official declaration of faith rather than paraphrasing doctrine without review.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
